{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:PredictedSpectra.QValueTransition","@type":"LeanModule","name":"PredictedSpectra.QValueTransition","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Positivity","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp"],"declarations":42,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.generator_fractions_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.generator_fractions_sum","kind":"theorem","line":221,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L221-L226","doc":"The two generator fractions sum to 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.sigma1_fraction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.sigma1_fraction","kind":"def","line":219,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L219-L219","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.sigma0_fraction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.sigma0_fraction","kind":"def","line":215,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L215-L218","doc":"Per-generator contribution fractions.\nσ₀ contributes 22% and σ₁ contributes 78% of the total. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.tritium_Q_q_negative","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.tritium_Q_q_negative","kind":"theorem","line":210,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L210-L213","doc":"The tritium Q_q is negative (daughter has lower action than parent). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.tritium_ln_ratio","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.tritium_ln_ratio","kind":"def","line":205,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L205-L208","doc":"Q_q-value for tritium: total log-ratio = -0.1021.\nSource: beta-decay-matrix.witness.json, σ₀ + σ₁ contributions. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.delta_q_decreasing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.delta_q_decreasing","kind":"theorem","line":184,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L184-L203","doc":"The self-deformation decreases with mass number: Δq_eff(A+1) < Δq_eff(A)\nfor A ≥ 2 and q > 1.  Tritium (A=3) has the largest correction. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.tritium_delta_q_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.tritium_delta_q_pos","kind":"theorem","line":179,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L179-L182","doc":"Tritium self-deformation is positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.tritium_self_deformation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.tritium_self_deformation","kind":"theorem","line":171,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L171-L177","doc":"Tritium self-deformation: Δq_eff(³H) = (3-1)/3² · ℏ_q² = 2/9 · ℏ_q².\nAt q = 1.110: ℏ_q² ≈ 0.009816, so Δq ≈ 0.00218. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.balance","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.balance","kind":"theorem","line":165,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L165-L165","doc":"The balance: S_par = S_dau(q+Δq) + S_e + S_ν + T_total.\nNote: daughter is evaluated at SHIFTED q. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.T_total","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.T_total","kind":"def","line":162,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L162-L162","doc":"Total kinetic energy of products. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.S_nu","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.S_nu","kind":"def","line":160,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L160-L160","doc":"Antineutrino action (= 0). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.S_e","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.S_e","kind":"def","line":158,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L158-L158","doc":"Electron action. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.S_dau_shifted","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.S_dau_shifted","kind":"def","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L156-L156","doc":"Daughter action at shifted q + Δq_eff. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.S_par","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.S_par","kind":"def","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L154-L154","doc":"Parent action at q. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.A_ge_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.A_ge_two","kind":"theorem","line":152,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L152-L152","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.A","kind":"def","line":151,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L151-L151","doc":"Mass number of parent. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.q_gt_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.q_gt_one","kind":"theorem","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L149-L149","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.q","kind":"def","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L148-L148","doc":"Original substrate parameter. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance.mk","kind":"ctor","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L146-L146","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QDeformedBalance","kind":"structure","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L137-L165","doc":"The q-deformed energy balance: the daughter is evaluated at\nthe SHIFTED q, not the original.\n\nS_q(parent) = S_{q+Δq}(daughter) + S_q(e) + S_q(ν̄) + kinetic + δ_q\n\nNote: this is NOT classical conservation.  The daughter nucleus\nlives in a shifted q-environment due to the re-reduction\nR2 moves in the Hecke algebra. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.singleCrossingDelta_classical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.singleCrossingDelta_classical","kind":"theorem","line":128,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L128-L131","doc":"At q = 1: crossing change releases zero energy (no weak force). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.singleCrossingDelta_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.singleCrossingDelta_pos","kind":"theorem","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L118-L126","doc":"The single-crossing energy difference is positive for q > 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.singleCrossingDelta","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.singleCrossingDelta","kind":"def","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L114-L116","doc":"Crossing energy at a single crossing change d→u: q - q⁻¹. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.delta_q_eff_classical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.delta_q_eff_classical","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L104-L108","doc":"At q = 1, the anomaly vanishes (classical limit). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.delta_q_eff_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.delta_q_eff_pos","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L87-L102","doc":"The self-deformation is positive for A ≥ 2 and q > 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.delta_q_eff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.delta_q_eff","kind":"def","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L82-L85","doc":"The self-deformation shift Δq_eff = (A-1)/A² · ℏ_q². ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.hbarQ'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.hbarQ'","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L78-L80","doc":"ℏ_q = 1 - q⁻¹ (quantum Planck constant). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QAnomaly.delta_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QAnomaly.delta_q","kind":"def","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L76-L76","doc":"The q-anomaly: δ_q = 𝒬_q - T_total. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QAnomaly.T_total","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QAnomaly.T_total","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L74-L74","doc":"Sum of observed kinetic energies T_e + T_ν̄ + T_recoil. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QAnomaly.Q_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QAnomaly.Q_q","kind":"def","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L72-L72","doc":"The categorical 𝒬_q. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QAnomaly.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QAnomaly.mk","kind":"ctor","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L70-L70","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QAnomaly","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QAnomaly","kind":"structure","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L64-L76","doc":"The q-anomaly: difference between categorical 𝒬_q and\nthe sum of observed kinetic energies.\n\nNote: this is NONZERO at q ≠ 1.  Classical energy conservation\n(δ_q = 0) holds ONLY at q = 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QqValue.value","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QqValue.value","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L55-L58","doc":"The 𝒬_q-value: action difference (primary definition). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:Q-value-transition","label":"def:Q-value-transition","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QqValue.S_antineutrino","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QqValue.S_antineutrino","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L53-L53","doc":"Categorical action of antineutrino S_q(ν̄) = 0 (unknot). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QqValue.S_electron_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QqValue.S_electron_pos","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L51-L51","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QqValue.S_electron","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QqValue.S_electron","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L50-L50","doc":"Categorical action of electron S_q(e). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QqValue.S_daughter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QqValue.S_daughter","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L48-L48","doc":"Categorical action of daughter nucleus S_q(N_dau). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QqValue.S_parent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QqValue.S_parent","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L46-L46","doc":"Categorical action of parent nucleus S_q(N_par). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QqValue.q_gt_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QqValue.q_gt_one","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L44-L44","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QqValue.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QqValue.q","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L43-L43","doc":"Substrate parameter. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QqValue.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QqValue.mk","kind":"ctor","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QqValue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QqValue","kind":"structure","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/q-value-transition.lean#L37-L53","doc":"The 𝒬_q-value of a beta decay transition.\nDefined as the categorical action difference — NOT as a sum of\nkinetic energies.  Classical energy conservation is NOT assumed. ","signatureChunk":0}]}